      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIOLLANTE (7) boasts a consistent overall record including two wins from 10 starts, the latest winning (29.82) over 515m at this track. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Looks well placed here and should prove hard to beat again. PAW OLENA (4) jumped cleanly last start and led all the way (25.67) at Ballarat in a Maiden over 450m. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. PAW JANNY (8) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 3 lengths into third (25.96) at Warrnambool in a Mix 6/7 over 450m. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Expecting another good run. CONFLICTED (5) is building a sequence of top-three results and can add to the tally.",
